Z||000013||Eriamjh||12-25-2001||07:56 PM||||This Michigan car has probably been through 14 winters, 5 of them under my ownership.<P>The bolts were rusty, but the underbody and control arms were not.  It was weird.  I've never had this much trouble with stinkin' bolts!  I blame cheap bushing sleeves!<P>Note: Front ball joints are not riveted (unless these were already replaced).  Lowers are pressed in.  Rear BJs are riveted in.  Doing those in the spring.||||reg||1
